WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 17]

02:01.620 --> 02:02.820
Mother of Trees,

02:04.940 --> 02:06.660
do you remember

02:08.300 --> 02:10.060
what he said to me?

02:11.820 --> 02:12.660
I said

02:13.450 --> 02:15.420
life is long.

02:15.820 --> 02:17.740
What if I can't afford you?

02:19.700 --> 02:20.740
He said.

02:21.940 --> 02:24.780
-Then I'll sell myself to you. -Then I'll sell myself to you.

02:24.780 --> 02:26.290
-One tael. -One tael.

02:26.540 --> 02:27.740
-Okay? -Okay?

02:29.460 --> 02:30.700
One tael.

02:32.940 --> 02:35.380
I wanted to cry when I heard it.

02:36.220 --> 02:37.079
Too expensive?

02:37.740 --> 02:38.660
How about

02:39.460 --> 02:40.390
one copper coin?

02:41.900 --> 02:43.700
He is such a calculating person.

02:44.220 --> 02:46.980
He wanted to do it for one copper coin.

02:51.400 --> 02:57.660
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

02:54.940 --> 02:55.579
Then,

02:56.500 --> 02:58.700
I gave him one copper coin.

03:00.010 --> 03:04.250
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

03:00.060 --> 03:01.370
One copper coin.

03:01.660 --> 03:03.980
He promised me for a lifetime.

03:05.420 --> 03:06.180
One copper coin.

03:05.640 --> 03:11.690
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

03:07.020 --> 03:08.420
Lu Li is sold to Liu Shao.

03:09.180 --> 03:10.300
Will you regret it?

03:11.450 --> 03:12.460
Never.

03:12.570 --> 03:17.650
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

03:14.100 --> 03:15.140
For a lifetime.

03:17.740 --> 03:18.860
For a lifetime.

03:19.079 --> 03:22.560
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

03:21.420 --> 03:23.460
If I miss you,

03:23.070 --> 03:26.680
♫I can't forget you♫

03:24.780 --> 03:26.680
I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

03:26.680 --> 03:30.329
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

03:28.420 --> 03:29.620
Then don't.

03:30.500 --> 03:33.150
♫I have no other choice♫

03:33.150 --> 03:36.880
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

03:36.880 --> 03:39.400
♫For billions of years♫

03:40.030 --> 03:43.940
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

03:43.940 --> 03:46.380
♫A few hasty nights♫

03:47.220 --> 03:50.950
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

03:50.900 --> 03:51.940
I didn't expect

03:50.950 --> 03:54.100
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

03:52.740 --> 03:55.060
a lifetime is so short.

03:54.360 --> 03:58.430
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch♫

03:56.860 --> 03:58.540
Love is bitter.

03:58.430 --> 04:01.030
♫And watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

03:59.579 --> 04:00.940
You don't have to be

04:01.700 --> 04:02.730
so sad.

04:04.460 --> 04:05.620
Let it go.

04:14.700 --> 04:16.019
Mother of Trees.

04:28.940 --> 04:30.250
Go away!

04:31.930 --> 04:35.060
Go to your heartless master!

04:37.610 --> 04:38.780
Go away!

04:42.100 --> 04:42.940
Go away!

04:44.980 --> 04:47.540
Go to your heartless master!

04:51.860 --> 04:54.700
So what if you suppress love?

04:55.940 --> 04:56.730
Back then,

04:57.570 --> 04:59.500
Lu Li once swore to me

05:00.380 --> 05:02.110
and promised me for a lifetime.

05:03.700 --> 05:06.460
If you really have any trace of Lu Li,

05:07.460 --> 05:10.500
you should ask yourself.

05:11.460 --> 05:12.860
Is today's ending

05:14.170 --> 05:17.020
worthy of the flowers blooming that day?

05:23.410 --> 05:24.700
Water hyacinth.

05:32.100 --> 05:33.659
Say something.

05:33.260 --> 05:36.750
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

05:37.300 --> 05:40.909
♫I can't forget you♫

05:40.909 --> 05:44.560
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

05:42.260 --> 05:43.190
Mother of Trees.

05:44.340 --> 05:45.180
Here's to you.

05:44.730 --> 05:47.380
♫I have no other choice♫

05:47.380 --> 05:51.110
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

05:47.820 --> 05:48.780
Here's to you.

05:51.110 --> 05:53.630
♫For billions of years♫

05:52.940 --> 05:54.070
Now I think about it.

05:54.260 --> 05:58.170
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

05:55.580 --> 05:57.540
I'm like your Demon Queen.

05:58.170 --> 06:00.600
♫A few hasty nights♫

05:58.340 --> 05:59.600
We're in the same boat.

06:00.020 --> 06:00.980
We all met

06:01.440 --> 06:05.180
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

06:02.020 --> 06:03.420
a man like this.

06:05.010 --> 06:06.460
In the end,

06:05.180 --> 06:08.330
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

06:06.740 --> 06:08.820
we are alone

06:08.580 --> 06:12.660
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch♫

06:09.700 --> 06:11.180
with a miserable ending.

06:12.660 --> 06:15.220
♫And watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

06:20.860 --> 06:21.860
Why is it wet?

06:24.260 --> 06:25.900
Why is it raining?

06:29.980 --> 06:31.220
Mother of Trees.

06:30.260 --> 06:36.890
♫The remaining flowers in the mirror reflect the moon in the water♫

06:31.820 --> 06:33.420
Are you crying?

06:35.580 --> 06:36.780
I see.

06:37.340 --> 06:39.340
I know why you are crying.

06:38.700 --> 06:42.940
♫We can't live up to such a good time♫

06:41.500 --> 06:43.220
What you love

06:44.300 --> 06:45.740
hurt you the most.

06:44.409 --> 06:51.000
♫Recalling the unforgettable glance at the beginning♫

06:47.900 --> 06:51.300
What can I do? He will never come back.

06:51.420 --> 06:54.990
♫I realized that it was a thousand years ago♫

06:54.990 --> 06:57.810
♫Is this bad luck, or good luck?♫

06:58.020 --> 07:01.500
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

07:01.500 --> 07:03.980
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

07:05.030 --> 07:08.640
♫The past has passed, so do not linger♫

07:07.860 --> 07:08.640
You're drunk.

07:08.640 --> 07:11.580
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

07:09.500 --> 07:10.630
Let me send you back.

07:12.000 --> 07:15.740
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

07:14.220 --> 07:14.940
Lu Li.

07:15.740 --> 07:19.140
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

07:19.140 --> 07:23.020
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch♫

07:19.620 --> 07:21.020
I miss you so much.

07:22.140 --> 07:23.660
I really miss you.

07:23.030 --> 07:27.110
♫And watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

07:27.260 --> 07:27.820
No.

07:27.550 --> 07:31.080
♫Life is like a grain of sand♫

07:30.900 --> 07:31.940
You're not him.

07:31.080 --> 07:34.500
♫It burns the fire in my heart♫

07:32.500 --> 07:34.020
You're not him.

07:34.640 --> 07:37.240
♫I want to burn myself to hear you say♫

07:35.500 --> 07:37.020
You bastard.

07:37.220 --> 07:38.900
You bastard.

07:37.240 --> 07:42.740
♫You have never changed♫

07:40.100 --> 07:42.820
But I miss him.

07:43.740 --> 07:45.300
I feel terrible.

07:45.820 --> 07:47.620
I feel terrible.

07:49.820 --> 07:51.220
I feel terrible.

07:51.260 --> 07:52.370
Let me send you home.

07:52.370 --> 07:53.300
No.

08:05.980 --> 08:08.460
Drunk Mother of Trees.

08:09.260 --> 08:12.130
Even the Demon King hasn't seen her like this.

08:13.140 --> 08:16.300
No wonder the Immortal Luo Ge has to give in.

08:22.210 --> 08:22.820
Mr. Tai.

08:23.300 --> 08:24.420
Come and help me.

08:25.180 --> 08:26.640
My brother has trapped me.

08:26.820 --> 08:28.950
I'm afraid something bad will happen.

08:33.260 --> 08:35.059
We have the same heart.

08:35.780 --> 08:38.020
Why are people different?

08:39.260 --> 08:41.220
Are you Lu Li

08:41.220 --> 08:42.980
only in my dream?

08:45.330 --> 08:46.260
Love

08:46.380 --> 08:47.440
is unpredictable.

08:47.540 --> 08:49.020
It's just like a dream.

08:50.540 --> 08:52.140
Why can't you understand it?

08:52.540 --> 08:54.060
About what?

08:55.820 --> 08:58.020
After you return to the Immortal Palace,

08:58.020 --> 08:59.420
think about it carefully

09:00.060 --> 09:01.190
and forget the past.

09:01.740 --> 09:02.380
Forget?

09:02.580 --> 09:04.060
I don't want to forget. Who wants to forget?

09:04.060 --> 09:05.340
You forget it.

09:05.340 --> 09:07.260
Put me down.

09:07.540 --> 09:08.900
Why are you looking at me?

09:08.900 --> 09:09.860
Immortal Luo Ge.

09:12.700 --> 09:13.820
What do you want?

09:14.140 --> 09:14.940
He Na.

09:15.700 --> 09:16.140
He...

09:16.700 --> 09:18.360
He wants me to erase my memory.

09:21.780 --> 09:22.580
Liu Shao.

09:27.820 --> 09:28.860
Help me.

09:31.700 --> 09:32.860
Forget the past?

09:32.860 --> 09:34.100
Go and do it yourself.

09:34.100 --> 09:35.130
Don't touch me.

09:36.810 --> 09:38.300
I don't want to forget.

09:38.890 --> 09:39.820
I'm asking her

09:40.740 --> 09:42.740
to go back to Immortal Palace with me

09:42.940 --> 09:44.100
and cultivate.

09:46.540 --> 09:48.220
I think she's doing well now.

09:48.770 --> 09:49.830
She is passionate.

09:50.060 --> 09:51.060
That's who she is.

09:51.300 --> 09:52.630
Why bother to change it?

09:55.180 --> 09:55.780
Exactly.

10:01.810 --> 10:03.070
Are you looking for me?

10:03.540 --> 10:06.070
Is there any news about the Lusitai Incident?

10:08.580 --> 10:09.180
Yes.

10:10.460 --> 10:11.320
Please tell me.

10:14.980 --> 10:15.420
It was...

10:15.420 --> 10:17.220
It was done by a heresy of the Demons,

10:17.220 --> 10:18.900
half-demon Lu Sheng.

10:21.770 --> 10:22.460
Fu.

10:25.620 --> 10:26.180
Fu.

10:27.650 --> 10:29.250
I'm Fu of the Aquatic Demons.

10:29.980 --> 10:31.580
Greetings, Immortal Luo Ge.

10:34.460 --> 10:35.700
Half-demon Lu Sheng?

10:36.060 --> 10:36.580
Yes.

10:37.340 --> 10:38.260
Immortal Luo Ge

10:38.340 --> 10:40.140
must be familiar with this name.

10:41.580 --> 10:42.900
Half-demon Lu Sheng

10:43.340 --> 10:45.260
is half-demon and half-human.

10:45.500 --> 10:46.960
He is good at the formation

10:47.100 --> 10:48.940
and loves collecting magic tools.

10:48.940 --> 10:51.900
He's a loyal subordinate of the God of the Moonlight.

10:52.540 --> 10:54.500
During the battle between the two gods,

10:54.500 --> 10:56.380
half heart of the God of the Moonlight

10:56.380 --> 10:59.110
was suppressed under the Four Seasons Monument.

10:59.420 --> 11:00.340
Lu Sheng

11:00.580 --> 11:01.580
is the one and only

11:01.980 --> 11:04.780
who wants to topple the Four Seasons Monument most

11:04.900 --> 11:06.020
in the world.

11:07.460 --> 11:08.500
Did he

11:09.340 --> 11:10.600
give the string to you?

11:12.460 --> 11:14.460
Bone-Corroding Harp was broken that day,

11:14.460 --> 11:15.980
and it infuriated the Immortal Palace.

11:15.980 --> 11:19.440
They forced the Aquatic Demons to repair it within three days.

11:20.540 --> 11:21.540
I had no choice

11:21.740 --> 11:23.740
but went to Lu Sheng.

11:26.460 --> 11:28.020
He gave me the string.

11:28.570 --> 11:29.180
And I

11:29.740 --> 11:30.860
gave the string

11:31.140 --> 11:32.570
to the Demon King.

11:33.700 --> 11:35.630
But this has nothing to do with him.

11:36.060 --> 11:37.060
It's all my fault.

11:37.980 --> 11:39.700
If you don't believe me,

11:39.930 --> 11:41.930
you can check Lu Sheng's residence.

11:42.540 --> 11:45.060
You have performed a Protection Spell here.

11:45.540 --> 11:46.820
We can't escape.

11:47.860 --> 11:49.340
Where is Lu Sheng now?

11:53.740 --> 11:54.580
She knows.

12:00.980 --> 12:02.860
Lu Sheng is Lu Li's master.

12:03.180 --> 12:04.140
She knows him.

12:41.660 --> 12:44.320
It's more comfortable to sleep at He Na's place.

12:53.890 --> 12:54.860
Immortal Luo Ge.

12:54.980 --> 12:56.220
Why are you here?

12:56.780 --> 12:59.510
Aren't you waiting for He Na to find out the truth?

13:00.180 --> 13:02.040
After you take me to find someone,

13:02.420 --> 13:04.080
maybe the truth will come out.

13:08.420 --> 13:09.750
Immortal, your face...

13:15.660 --> 13:16.570
What happened?

13:20.140 --> 13:20.820
A dog bit me.

13:22.860 --> 13:25.020
What kind of dog

13:25.380 --> 13:27.380
is so gentle and left such few marks?

13:28.060 --> 13:30.940
You'd better learn the Dog-Beating Stick from the human.

13:30.940 --> 13:31.500
Maybe

13:31.540 --> 13:34.580
it can protect your fair face.

14:03.140 --> 14:03.940
Liu Shao.

14:04.380 --> 14:05.510
I wonder if your head

14:06.300 --> 14:08.800
can take my Dog-Beating Stick?

14:14.700 --> 14:16.300
You are not him.

14:17.860 --> 14:19.260
You bastard.

14:19.660 --> 14:20.500
Immortal.

14:20.740 --> 14:21.180
Yesterday, I...

14:21.180 --> 14:21.930
Shut up.

14:22.380 --> 14:23.340
One more word,

14:23.700 --> 14:25.900
I'll make you can't talk for three days.

14:50.380 --> 14:51.780
The things were exposed.

14:52.220 --> 14:54.020
Luo Ge will be here soon.

14:54.740 --> 14:56.340
You can use this magic weapon

14:56.740 --> 14:59.070
to make Luo Ge lose his power temporarily.

14:59.500 --> 15:01.740
Take this chance to kill Liu Shao.

15:04.370 --> 15:06.450
You can imprison Luo Ge here.

15:07.340 --> 15:09.060
I have a way to persuade him

15:09.380 --> 15:11.310
to split the Four Seasons Monument

15:11.540 --> 15:12.660
and become

15:13.260 --> 15:15.380
the real God of the Moonlight.

15:33.100 --> 15:34.300
What are you writing?

15:35.940 --> 15:37.020
Over the wastelands,

15:37.020 --> 15:38.620
there is an oasis in the northwest.

15:38.620 --> 15:39.740
The person living there

15:39.740 --> 15:41.460
is an elder of our race.

15:41.660 --> 15:43.140
Take this letter to him.

15:55.340 --> 15:57.270
Luo Ge set a Protection Spell here.

16:07.140 --> 16:08.700
I will work with all my people

16:08.700 --> 16:09.780
to break the Protection Spell

16:09.780 --> 16:10.780
and send you away.

16:16.210 --> 16:17.270
You don't trust me?

16:19.900 --> 16:20.580
Fu,

16:21.220 --> 16:22.780
We've grown up together.

16:23.420 --> 16:25.150
No one knows you better than me.

16:25.380 --> 16:26.740
The incident of Luositai

16:26.740 --> 16:28.660
must have something to do with you.

16:28.660 --> 16:30.340
You trapped me last night

16:30.940 --> 16:32.410
because you wanted to find Luo Ge

16:32.410 --> 16:34.330
and admit that the spirit vein is yours

16:34.330 --> 16:35.710
and take everything I did,

16:35.710 --> 16:36.500
right?

16:38.940 --> 16:40.140
You have to leave now.

16:40.140 --> 16:41.100
Answer me.

16:45.540 --> 16:46.780
You are arrogant

16:47.180 --> 16:49.580
because you have been trapped in the water.

16:49.620 --> 16:51.350
I don't blame you for doing this

16:51.620 --> 16:53.660
because you feel unfair in your heart.

16:53.660 --> 16:54.620
But Fu,

16:55.380 --> 16:57.060
most of the dead are innocent.

16:58.140 --> 16:59.800
Someone has to take the blame.

17:00.220 --> 17:01.220
I'm the Demon King

17:01.700 --> 17:02.820
and your brother.

17:03.700 --> 17:05.030
This is what I should do.

17:07.940 --> 17:08.970
So do you think

17:09.540 --> 17:11.339
you are really doing this for me?

17:14.900 --> 17:16.960
This is the only thing I can do for you.

17:17.220 --> 17:19.220
But that's not what I want you to do.

17:23.339 --> 17:24.060
Fu,

17:27.339 --> 17:28.800
What did you put in the tea?

17:30.260 --> 17:31.520
Debilitating Powder.

17:31.740 --> 17:33.940
The most common drug in the demon world.

17:34.460 --> 17:34.990
Brother.

17:35.420 --> 17:36.420
Let me tell you

17:37.060 --> 17:38.740
what I really want you

17:39.340 --> 17:40.460
to do for me.

18:01.580 --> 18:02.820
Brahma Lotus.

18:03.540 --> 18:05.660
This is really a top-class magic weapon.

18:05.660 --> 18:08.460
It is made with the Demon Palace's tens of thousands of years of history.

18:08.460 --> 18:10.060
It is really amazing.

18:49.300 --> 18:49.900
Brother,

18:50.820 --> 18:51.880
did you sleep well?

18:53.020 --> 18:54.700
What exactly do you want?

18:56.100 --> 18:57.940
Do you want to be the Demon King?

18:59.980 --> 19:02.140
If I really want to be the Demon King,

19:03.050 --> 19:04.310
would you give it to me?

19:06.860 --> 19:08.060
If you really want it,

19:09.740 --> 19:10.860
I can give it to you.

19:13.220 --> 19:14.350
Demon King in White.

19:14.810 --> 19:16.140
His race is cursed.

19:16.980 --> 19:18.420
They can't leave the water

19:18.420 --> 19:20.140
and be restricted everywhere.

19:20.140 --> 19:21.970
And they have to lower their heads to others.

19:21.970 --> 19:23.180
Why do I want

19:23.340 --> 19:24.300
such a title?

19:26.140 --> 19:27.540
What exactly do you want?

19:34.820 --> 19:36.480
I want my brother to come back.

19:37.820 --> 19:39.740
I'll do anything for that.

19:52.820 --> 19:54.660
Lu Li planted this for me.

19:55.660 --> 19:56.590
It's very sweet.

19:57.860 --> 19:58.780
Mr. Lu Sheng.

19:59.940 --> 20:02.740
Do you remember Lu Li planted the pear tree for you?

20:05.450 --> 20:06.700
But he's not the first person

20:06.700 --> 20:08.300
to plant the pear tree for me.

20:11.940 --> 20:13.580
I'm a half-demon.

20:13.580 --> 20:15.310
Both humans and demons hate me.

20:15.900 --> 20:17.100
A long time ago,

20:17.700 --> 20:19.900
I was exiled to an extremely cold place.

20:21.010 --> 20:22.870
I was infected with lung disease.

20:23.660 --> 20:24.780
One day,

20:26.100 --> 20:27.700
an amazing person came

20:27.700 --> 20:29.180
and adopted me.

20:32.300 --> 20:34.020
Because I have a cough,

20:35.260 --> 20:37.900
he planted a pear tree for me.

20:38.940 --> 20:40.420
Every year,

20:40.420 --> 20:43.180
he picked the first pear for me.

20:46.300 --> 20:48.230
Who said you can't practice magic?

20:48.580 --> 20:49.940
You are not useless.

20:51.380 --> 20:52.300
From now on,

20:53.180 --> 20:54.910
I will teach you the formation.

20:55.700 --> 20:56.900
After you master it,

20:57.620 --> 20:59.020
you can use the formation

20:59.140 --> 21:01.340
to teach those who bullied you a lesson.

21:09.970 --> 21:11.370
The one who gave you pears

21:11.540 --> 21:13.070
is the God of the Moonlight?

21:13.980 --> 21:14.780
Yes.

21:15.180 --> 21:17.530
So you want the God of the Moonlight to come back,

21:17.530 --> 21:19.260
as well as the half of the heart?

21:21.220 --> 21:22.180
But you know

21:22.180 --> 21:24.240
what's inside that half of the heart.

21:25.700 --> 21:26.980
If it reappears,

21:28.100 --> 21:30.060
the three worlds will be in misery.

21:31.700 --> 21:33.940
What does it have to do with me?

21:36.420 --> 21:38.220
All I did in my life

21:38.220 --> 21:39.900
is for the God of the Moonlight.

21:39.900 --> 21:41.030
I don't understand.

21:41.580 --> 21:42.620
Why did you set him up?

21:42.620 --> 21:44.010
Why did you kill him?

21:44.660 --> 21:46.580
Lu Li got killed because of you.

21:46.580 --> 21:48.580
You made him lose his mind.

21:50.380 --> 21:51.340
Now,

21:51.340 --> 21:52.670
you're here to hurt him.

21:54.700 --> 21:56.220
You are his destined enemy.

21:56.220 --> 21:57.300
I won't let you go.

22:10.340 --> 22:10.900
Luo Ge.

22:30.500 --> 22:33.170
This magic weapon can trap Luo Ge.

22:33.660 --> 22:35.980
Now it's time to kill Liu Shao.

22:38.300 --> 22:38.850
No.

22:39.300 --> 22:41.180
Someone tampered with the formation.

22:41.180 --> 22:41.740
Lu Sheng.

22:42.500 --> 22:43.890
This is not the Immortal Trapping Formation.

22:43.890 --> 22:46.100
This is the Immortal Devouring Formation.

22:46.100 --> 22:46.960
This formation

22:47.340 --> 22:49.020
will kill everyone around

22:49.330 --> 22:51.620
no matter if you are a human or an immortal.

22:51.620 --> 22:53.680
We will all die under this formation.

22:54.060 --> 22:55.320
Even you can't escape.

23:05.090 --> 23:05.900
It's Fu.

23:06.460 --> 23:08.620
Fu tampered with the Brahma Lotus.

23:11.140 --> 23:12.820
Luo Ge has the strongest spiritual power.

23:12.820 --> 23:15.170
So the first one to be devoured by the Immortal Devouring Formation

23:15.170 --> 23:15.860
is him.

23:20.300 --> 23:20.900
Oh no.

23:21.690 --> 23:22.420
Luo Ge!

23:22.660 --> 23:23.620
You can't die.

23:31.220 --> 23:34.180
She activates the Sun Spirit to attract the Immortal Devouring Formation.

23:34.180 --> 23:35.060
Why?

23:35.700 --> 23:36.940
Why did she do that?

23:38.140 --> 23:39.600
Why do I feel heartbroken?

23:46.540 --> 23:48.340
I can't let Liu Shao die for me.

23:49.380 --> 23:50.620
Moon Sword!

23:57.410 --> 23:58.100
No!

24:00.220 --> 24:01.620
Don't use your vitality.

24:02.220 --> 24:04.180
A large amount of spiritual power will release

24:04.180 --> 24:05.580
and you will die for sure.

24:05.780 --> 24:07.060
If you die,

24:07.540 --> 24:09.060
who else can I find

24:09.900 --> 24:12.300
to be the God of the Moonlight in this world?

24:13.140 --> 24:13.980
In this world,

24:14.380 --> 24:15.780
only the God of the Moonlight and Li

24:15.780 --> 24:18.060
would plant the pear tree and make pear soup for me.

24:18.060 --> 24:20.100
But I sacrificed Li's life

24:20.500 --> 24:22.900
and failed to save the God of the Moonlight.

24:23.100 --> 24:23.860
It seems

24:24.420 --> 24:26.080
I won't get to see your return.

24:26.780 --> 24:27.660
But at least

24:28.460 --> 24:31.100
I can still protect half of the God's heart.

24:54.660 --> 24:55.260
Lu Sheng,

24:56.100 --> 24:59.020
if you master the formations and spells I taught you,

24:59.020 --> 25:01.580
I hope you can get rid of the restriction of your half-demon identity

25:01.580 --> 25:02.860
and live your life

25:03.460 --> 25:04.520
the way you wish to.

25:05.620 --> 25:06.550
Unfortunately,

25:06.970 --> 25:08.980
it's too late for me.

25:39.700 --> 25:41.630
Don't waste your spiritual power.

25:42.140 --> 25:43.620
It's useless.

25:48.220 --> 25:49.740
I have only one obsession

25:50.980 --> 25:52.460
in my life.

25:55.380 --> 25:57.020
That is to bring the God back.

25:58.450 --> 26:00.130
Because of it,

26:00.660 --> 26:02.540
I adopted Lu Li.

26:07.490 --> 26:09.380
Master, I'm back.

26:10.740 --> 26:12.820
Master.

26:13.540 --> 26:15.890
I'll make you Chuanbei herb-pear juice.

26:15.890 --> 26:17.340
It's sweet.

26:17.340 --> 26:18.670
I'm sure you'll like it.

26:20.540 --> 26:21.200
In this way,

26:21.460 --> 26:23.580
I can find the best doctor in the world

26:23.820 --> 26:26.750
and buy the best and most expensive medicine for you.

26:26.940 --> 26:27.450
Master,

26:27.780 --> 26:28.780
you are ill.

26:31.140 --> 26:32.400
Take care of yourself.

26:33.060 --> 26:35.780
You can live your own life

26:36.380 --> 26:38.180
and love the one you love.

26:40.380 --> 26:41.300
You

26:41.700 --> 26:43.630
don't seem to want me to be with her.

26:43.980 --> 26:45.500
You can't be together.

26:45.620 --> 26:47.380
You want to know your identity,

26:47.500 --> 26:49.740
so I asked you to come to the  Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

26:49.740 --> 26:51.200
to pull out the Moon Sword,

26:51.460 --> 26:53.820
not to enjoy romance.

26:55.220 --> 26:55.900
Master,

26:56.740 --> 26:58.740
if I become the God of the Moonlight,

26:59.500 --> 27:00.740
Liu Shao will die.

27:01.420 --> 27:03.750
You want to sacrifice an innocent person.

27:04.620 --> 27:06.260
Why don't you start with me?

27:07.260 --> 27:08.140
Fine.

27:09.220 --> 27:11.540
Give me back half of your heart.

27:17.180 --> 27:18.980
Do you really want to die for her?

27:18.980 --> 27:21.180
You value this half of the heart so much.

27:22.020 --> 27:23.940
Liu Shao has filled it with....

27:26.780 --> 27:27.500
Master,

27:30.460 --> 27:32.660
remember to take your medicine on time.

27:34.180 --> 27:34.940
Take care.

27:43.580 --> 27:44.770
Lu Li.

27:46.450 --> 27:48.580
It's my obsession that killed you.

27:51.050 --> 27:52.740
I'm sorry.

28:00.900 --> 28:02.380
Be careful of Fu.

28:59.680 --> 29:08.670
[Half-demon Lu Sheng]

29:21.730 --> 29:25.380
[Half-demon Lu Sheng]

29:31.060 --> 29:32.260
Why did you save me?

29:35.180 --> 29:36.380
Don't think too much.

29:36.900 --> 29:38.300
Immortals are merciful.

29:38.980 --> 29:40.440
No matter who is in danger,

29:40.500 --> 29:41.570
I will save them.

29:42.010 --> 29:43.610
And you are one of the living.

29:43.820 --> 29:44.900
I can't

29:44.900 --> 29:46.460
let you die.

29:56.140 --> 29:57.020
What is this?

29:59.220 --> 30:01.820
The Tears of the Half-Demon Lu Sheng just shed.

30:10.150 --> 30:12.130
[Half-demon Lu Sheng's Tomb]

30:15.260 --> 30:16.050
What I want is

30:16.260 --> 30:18.390
the ambitious you from 9000 years ago.

30:18.660 --> 30:20.180
You were gentle

30:20.180 --> 30:21.420
but full of ambition.

30:21.980 --> 30:23.380
You can leave the water.

30:23.740 --> 30:25.140
You can be free.

30:25.820 --> 30:26.940
You have become like this

30:26.940 --> 30:28.020
because of me.

30:30.260 --> 30:30.940
Fu,

30:31.860 --> 30:32.780
you are right.

30:33.380 --> 30:35.340
I was too arrogant when I was young.

30:41.890 --> 30:43.780
I just practiced the flute here.

30:43.980 --> 30:45.450
What does it have to do with you?

30:45.450 --> 30:46.540
Cut the crap.

30:47.220 --> 30:48.580
Nothing good comes out of

30:48.580 --> 30:50.910
Aquatic Demons coming to the Human world.

30:54.540 --> 30:56.620
How dare you resist, you demon?

31:08.780 --> 31:10.980
A man should have dignity and not kneel.

31:11.020 --> 31:12.700
It seems that the Immortal Palace

31:12.700 --> 31:14.580
regards dignity as garbage.

31:18.020 --> 31:19.020
My brother

31:19.860 --> 31:21.660
was the pride of the Aquatic Demons.

31:21.660 --> 31:24.260
The people who had been bullied, including me,

31:24.660 --> 31:26.920
saw the hope of the Aquatic Demons in you.

31:29.860 --> 31:31.020
Back then...

31:32.300 --> 31:33.370
it was my fault.

31:34.210 --> 31:35.620
I was too impulsive

31:36.340 --> 31:38.070
and got everyone into trouble.

31:43.900 --> 31:44.500
Brother.

31:44.700 --> 31:45.300
Fu.

31:47.540 --> 31:48.740
You're finally back.

31:49.130 --> 31:50.020
Demon King.

31:57.740 --> 31:58.740
What do you want?

31:59.980 --> 32:01.510
How dare you Aquatic Demons

32:01.980 --> 32:04.580
insult the people from the Immortal Palace?

32:05.420 --> 32:06.780
What do you think I want?

32:09.220 --> 32:10.500
He insulted me.

32:10.980 --> 32:12.380
I didn't hurt him.

32:15.170 --> 32:16.300
Let go of Fu!

32:20.650 --> 32:21.910
Don't hurt my brother!

32:22.420 --> 32:25.280
I think you won't regret it until you see the result.

32:25.900 --> 32:28.100
Do you want to know how your people died?

32:35.060 --> 32:36.340
My Pearl of Fire

32:36.810 --> 32:38.860
can absorb the water in the body.

32:39.100 --> 32:40.260
Let me show you.

32:45.100 --> 32:45.630
Brother.

32:46.050 --> 32:47.100
Don't worry about me.

32:47.100 --> 32:48.100
Kill them!

32:48.220 --> 32:49.260
Kill them all!

32:53.580 --> 32:54.860
You have guts.

32:56.020 --> 32:56.750
I admire you.

32:58.300 --> 32:59.420
Open his mouth.

32:59.930 --> 33:01.060
Make him swallow it.

33:09.810 --> 33:10.500
No!

33:15.690 --> 33:16.620
What did you say?

33:18.540 --> 33:19.780
Please don't.

33:20.530 --> 33:22.180
You're begging me now.

33:23.420 --> 33:24.140
But I remember

33:24.140 --> 33:25.870
you were mocking us immortals.

33:26.140 --> 33:27.620
You said we don't have dignity

33:27.620 --> 33:29.100
and kneel.

33:36.380 --> 33:36.980
Brother.

33:37.330 --> 33:38.060
Don't.

33:38.420 --> 33:39.210
Don't!

33:52.380 --> 33:52.890
No.

33:57.340 --> 33:58.900
Can you let Fu go?

33:59.260 --> 34:00.020
Yes.

34:01.060 --> 34:02.740
As long as you

34:04.180 --> 34:05.180
swallow it,

34:08.900 --> 34:09.780
I'll let him go.

34:14.179 --> 34:14.659
No.

34:15.860 --> 34:16.409
No!

34:16.659 --> 34:17.300
No!

34:18.060 --> 34:18.780
No!

34:19.739 --> 34:21.139
Brother!

34:23.820 --> 34:24.580
Demon King!

34:24.580 --> 34:25.340
Brother!

34:26.620 --> 34:28.020
Brother!

34:46.219 --> 34:46.889
Brother!

34:47.980 --> 34:48.510
Brother.

34:49.860 --> 34:50.940
He Na.

34:50.940 --> 34:53.340
You're a rare genius

34:53.659 --> 34:54.820
with amazing magic,

34:55.460 --> 34:56.540
and you can leave the water,

34:56.540 --> 34:58.140
but what's the use?

34:58.820 --> 35:00.260
Look at your brother.

35:01.100 --> 35:02.430
Can he leave this place?

35:04.180 --> 35:05.620
Can the Aquatic Demons

35:06.300 --> 35:07.620
leave this place?

35:09.020 --> 35:10.660
How dare you

35:10.660 --> 35:12.300
disrespect the world

35:12.300 --> 35:14.100
and fight against us immortals?

35:16.420 --> 35:18.340
Stay here

35:18.610 --> 35:20.140
and be an inferior race.

35:22.740 --> 35:23.270
Brother.

35:24.180 --> 35:24.980
Brother!

35:32.740 --> 35:34.600
They said we are an inferior race.

35:34.700 --> 35:37.100
They said you are not qualified to be proud.

35:37.780 --> 35:41.440
They said you're not qualified to challenge the Immortal Palace.

35:41.700 --> 35:43.160
But do you really admit it?

35:45.700 --> 35:47.430
The Pearl of Fire you swallowed

35:48.260 --> 35:50.060
has hurt you for ten years.

35:50.580 --> 35:51.710
Have you forgotten?

35:53.740 --> 35:55.270
Even if you have forgotten,

35:56.940 --> 35:58.530
I remember everything.

36:09.580 --> 36:11.440
I remember his name is Xie Lingqi.

36:12.020 --> 36:14.280
He was frustrated in the Immortal Palace

36:14.500 --> 36:17.540
and he dared to come to the Aquatic Demons to mess around.

36:17.540 --> 36:20.020
I caught him with Lu Sheng

36:21.100 --> 36:22.300
and threatened him.

36:35.180 --> 36:35.930
You are...

36:39.460 --> 36:40.940
It's you.

36:41.140 --> 36:42.580
It's been 900 years.

36:43.220 --> 36:44.280
Practitioner Xie.

36:44.460 --> 36:45.500
How are you?

36:46.850 --> 36:47.650
It's useless.

36:48.940 --> 36:50.580
Do you know who taught Lu Sheng

36:50.580 --> 36:52.060
the formations?

36:53.300 --> 36:54.960
It's the God of the Moonlight.

36:56.620 --> 36:58.980
When you forced my brother,

36:59.220 --> 37:01.150
have you ever thought about today?

37:05.300 --> 37:07.060
Fine.

37:07.740 --> 37:08.400
I was wrong.

37:09.180 --> 37:09.900
I was wrong.

37:11.380 --> 37:11.910
Let me go.

37:13.460 --> 37:14.260
Don't kill me.

37:17.540 --> 37:19.780
You're a practitioner from the Immortal Palace.

37:19.780 --> 37:22.510
How can you beg for mercy from an inferior person?

37:23.340 --> 37:24.070
Listen to me.

37:25.300 --> 37:25.980
I can't die.

37:26.740 --> 37:27.600
I can't die yet.

37:29.540 --> 37:31.170
I haven't got what I want yet.

37:31.820 --> 37:33.280
Someone is waiting for me.

37:33.460 --> 37:34.500
What you want.

37:35.060 --> 37:36.700
Lord Wuxiang of the Immortal Palace

37:36.700 --> 37:38.940
would be promoted to an Immortal probably.

37:38.940 --> 37:41.340
Immortal Master Wanwu will be promoted too.

37:41.340 --> 37:42.330
Can you get

37:42.620 --> 37:44.410
what you want in your life?

37:50.460 --> 37:51.320
How about this?

37:52.020 --> 37:53.300
Let's work together.

37:54.020 --> 37:55.780
Help me do what I want,

37:56.060 --> 37:57.940
and I'll get what you want.

38:01.540 --> 38:02.540
What do you think?

38:18.450 --> 38:20.180
He agreed to cooperate with me.

38:20.420 --> 38:21.100
Later,

38:21.940 --> 38:23.700
Luo Ge set a trap for him.

38:24.380 --> 38:26.060
I forced him to jump in.

38:26.700 --> 38:28.030
I gave him demon energy.

38:28.740 --> 38:31.380
This is for you. It's demon energy.

38:33.140 --> 38:34.420
You know what to do.

38:36.580 --> 38:38.310
I used the Water Hyacinth Spell

38:38.380 --> 38:39.980
to get his demon aura into his bones

38:39.980 --> 38:41.060
and make everyone of the Immortal Palace

38:41.060 --> 38:43.060
think he was a spy of the demon world.

38:43.980 --> 38:45.510
He couldn't defend himself

38:46.180 --> 38:48.580
and was thrown into the Bone-melting Pool.

38:53.660 --> 38:54.190
Brother,

38:55.500 --> 38:57.100
I get avenge for you.

38:58.260 --> 38:59.860
Stop thinking about the past

39:00.220 --> 39:01.420
and be free again.

39:04.140 --> 39:04.740
Fu,

39:06.900 --> 39:08.900
from the day I became the Demon King,

39:10.100 --> 39:11.500
I have no freedom.

39:12.140 --> 39:13.930
I want to give it back to you.

39:15.340 --> 39:16.860
I did these

39:17.340 --> 39:18.580
cruel things,

39:18.580 --> 39:20.650
not for the title of Demon King.

39:23.700 --> 39:24.760
You are my brother.

39:25.340 --> 39:26.580
You knelt for me

39:27.220 --> 39:29.350
and swallowed the Pearl of Fire for me.

39:30.180 --> 39:31.660
I would do anything.

39:32.340 --> 39:34.260
I want to topple the Four Seasons Monument

39:34.260 --> 39:35.260
and overthrow the world.

39:35.260 --> 39:36.720
I want to give you freedom.

39:37.580 --> 39:40.410
But if we can find the immortal energy of Immortal Ze Shui,

39:40.410 --> 39:41.940
we can also save our people.

39:42.620 --> 39:44.950
You don't have to sacrifice so many lives.

39:47.700 --> 39:48.900
Enough.

39:49.780 --> 39:50.740
Because you know

39:52.540 --> 39:53.900
it's useless.

39:57.060 --> 39:57.860
Your Majesty,

39:58.260 --> 40:00.540
Immortal Luo Ge and Miss Liu are back.

40:00.900 --> 40:03.340
They want to see you and General Fu.

40:04.100 --> 40:04.780
Luo Ge?

40:05.210 --> 40:06.010
He's not dead.

40:08.220 --> 40:09.750
There is no actual evidence

40:10.020 --> 40:11.950
that it has something to do with Fu.

40:13.140 --> 40:14.780
Then please tell me

40:16.380 --> 40:19.110
which one of you Aquatic Demons let the news slip?

40:21.420 --> 40:22.180
Is that you?

40:31.420 --> 40:32.100
He Na.

40:32.380 --> 40:35.860
The Immortal is just taking Fu back to imprison him temporarily.

40:35.860 --> 40:36.820
It will be fine.

40:37.380 --> 40:38.440
I'm the Demon King.

40:39.700 --> 40:40.780
If I say no,

40:41.620 --> 40:42.740
it's no.

40:45.780 --> 40:46.710
Unfortunately,

40:47.780 --> 40:49.580
in this small Aquatic Demons,

40:50.100 --> 40:52.540
not everyone listens to the Demon King.

40:56.420 --> 40:57.020
I'll go.
